    {
        "text": "8:52 P.M. \\ Cloudy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen Slums"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell us where the Rat King is and nobody has to die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh- what?! What's a Rat King... I don't even know what that is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dare you to say 'what' again...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Mr. Capone said not to rough up civilians...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does this piece of shit look like a civilian to you? I bet you're Infected, ain't you, cazzo? You still wanna play dumb?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "P- please! Don't hurt me! I really don't know anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cat got your tongue?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ng... gah... glehh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, forget about this one. It ain't worth it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Checking our list, looks like the next lucky contestant is some poor finball hawker. Lives right around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like a waste of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah... aaagh! They broke... my arm... those sons of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to... tell them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's him. Over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can I help you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hold up. Check the mug over there. I got a bad feeling about him.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Some Lungmen triad? Mr. Capone says they're a bunch of pushovers.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I got a question for ya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't want any trouble, right? Just give us a clean answer and we'll be on our way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...There's blood on your knuckles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, pardon me. I was cleaning out the trash earlier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But a couple of upright citizens like yourselves, you ain't trash, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that a threat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a smart girl, you can figure it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I refuse to help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...refuse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think that came out wrong, girly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "It sounded like you said you were dumpster garbage eager to get beaten half to death in that alleyway over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Waai Fu, I'm pretty sure that scream I just heard was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Was 'garbage,' the word you just used?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because one must be thorough and prepared for all eventualities, I will ask one more question: is that how you refer to the people here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't got time to waste talkin' shit with you, start talk\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh- what was that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "You better\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.55
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 120,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what, the kind of scum you are, I'll take you all on at once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not once in recorded history has evil triumphed over justice, and you evildoers who indiscriminately prey on the weak are not even worth a mention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this?! How does she move like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just shoot her alrea\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...not so fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah! Hey! Let go of me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what you remind me of? A rotten finfish three days after the freezer lost power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...nothing. I shouldn't try to copy Waai Fu's battle banter. I'll take the direct approach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "S- so strong! Agh! Y- you're gonna break my arm! Stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Drop your weapon. And get out of my sight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Al- alright already! Just let me go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I should probably break a bone or two just to be safe. You've got a real dangerous weapon there, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaagh! P- please stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh- what's the deal with these two? Nobody warned us about any targets around here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just get the hell outta here first. We'll talk later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care what crew you guys are with, next time ain't gonna go your way. Damned Lungmenites.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, we're not triads. Why do they always have to judge a book by its cover...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it, there's people to save. Over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move! We're here to help!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Fil?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're fine. It's just a flesh wound. Sit still and I'll go get a doctor. I won't be long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Fil! Don't worry about me. You have to go find Uncle Tung!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's where they're going next!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Slum Dweller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]